{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/038",
  "family": "NOR10"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u08982",
   "en": "She did.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08983",
   "en": "Forget about her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08984",
   "en": "She's still with you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08985",
   "en": "It's Saren's fault.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08986",
   "en": "So do I.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08987",
   "en": "Don't.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08988",
   "en": "We'll never know.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08989",
   "en": "Does it matter?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08990",
   "en": "Lust for power.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08991",
   "en": "Pick a topic.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08992",
   "en": "Tell me more about you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08993",
   "en": "Nothing important.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08994",
   "en": "You must get lonely.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08995",
   "en": "Do you like it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08996",
   "en": "Sounds boring.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08997",
   "en": "Do you like your job?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08998",
   "en": "It's not foolish.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08999",
   "en": "Must have made her mad.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09000",
   "en": "I'm fascinating?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09001",
   "en": "Don't try to study me!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09002",
   "en": "I wasn't serious.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09003",
   "en": "Actually, I think I was talking about my interest in you. And making a fool of myself in the process. As I said, I'm not used to dealing with people. Especially humans.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09004",
   "en": "I did not really know much about your species when we first met, Shepard. I found it hard to take humanity seriously. Your kind always seemed so rushed and high-strung.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09005",
   "en": "That is true. At first, I thought that was a weakness of your species. After spending time with you and your crew, however, I think it may actually be an advantage.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09006",
   "en": "It has. I have been watching you and your crew. It has taught me a lot about your species.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09007",
   "en": "As I said, I was ignorant about your species. But I have been watching you and your crew. I feel as if I have learned a great deal.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09008",
   "en": "You humans are creatures of action. You pursue your goals with an almost indomitable determination. It is an admirable trait, but also an intimidating one.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09009",
   "en": "Unfortunately, the rest of the galaxy sees humanity as something of a bully. You run over anyone in your path to get what you want.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09010",
   "en": "Unfortunately, that is how most of the galaxy sees you. I understand why they think that way, though I don't necessarily agree with them. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09011",
   "en": "No, but there are consequences. Unfortunately, the rest of the galaxy sees humanity as a bully. You run over anyone who gets in your way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09012",
   "en": "It's up to people like you to change their minds, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09013",
   "en": "There is a reason the Council chose you to become a Spectre. They saw something special in you -- the best of what humanity has to offer.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09014",
   "en": "But you should. The Council made you a Spectre because of what they saw in you. You are special, Commander. You represent the best of what humanity can offer.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09015",
   "en": "I looked into your history. I know what happened on Akuze. The fact that you survived shows a remarkable strength.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09016",
   "en": "I looked into your history. I know what you did during the Blitz. It was a remarkable display of courage and heroism.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09017",
   "en": "I looked into your history. I know what you did on Torfan. I cannot even imagine how horrible that must have been, but you did what had to be done.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09018",
   "en": "I apologize, Commander. After our last conversation, I was afraid I would say something stupid again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09019",
   "en": "I am sorry. I know it was wrong, but after our last conversation, I was too embarrassed to approach you directly. I was afraid I would say something stupid again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09020",
   "en": "I wanted to know more about you. To understand what made you into the woman you are. There is something compelling about you, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09021",
   "en": "I wanted to know more about you. To understand what made you into the man you are. There's something compelling about you, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09022",
   "en": "I admit, your connection to the Protheans had something to do with my initial interest. But it has grown beyond that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09023",
   "en": "My interest in you, however, is strictly professional. I want to make that clear.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09024",
   "en": "You intrigue me, Shepard. But I was not sure if it was appropriate to act on my feelings.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09025",
   "en": "Obsessed? All I did was look up some information from the extranet. I would hardly call that an obsession.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09026",
   "en": "I apologize if I offended you, Commander. But you had better get used to this kind of attention. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09027",
   "en": "You are the first human Spectre, the most visible representative of your species. The eyes of the entire galaxy are watching you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09028",
   "en": "Understood, Commander. I will keep our relationship strictly professional from now on.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09029",
   "en": "Your instincts were not completely wrong, Commander. I did feel some attraction to you. But I felt it would be inappropriate to act on it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09030",
   "en": "It is obvious that you and Lt. Alenko already have some type of relationship. I would not want to come between you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09031",
   "en": "It is obvious you and Williams already have some type of relationship. I would not want to come between you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09032",
   "en": "Your instincts were not completely wrong, Commander. I did feel some attraction to you. But I was not sure if it would be appropriate to let it grow into something more.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09033",
   "en": "I thought there might already be a relationship between you and Lt. Alenko.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09034",
   "en": "I thought there might already be a relationship between you and Chief Williams.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09035",
   "en": "Of course, Shepard. What did you want to talk about?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09036",
   "en": "We don't have the luxury of time. An asari can live for a thousand years. We're lucky if we hit 150.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09037",
   "en": "Has your opinion changed at all?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09038",
   "en": "So you saw us as some kind of joke?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09039",
   "en": "You're scared of us?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09040",
   "en": "You're basically saying we bully other people to get our way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09041",
   "en": "You can't argue with results.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09042",
   "en": "I'm doing the best I can, Liara.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09043",
   "en": "I don't care what the rest of the galaxy thinks about us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09044",
   "en": "You didn't need to go behind my back. I would've told you whatever you wanted to know.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09045",
   "en": "Now you're digging into my past? Invading my privacy?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09046",
   "en": "Why are you so interested in me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09047",
   "en": "Are you sure you're interested in me? Or is it my visions of the Protheans?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09048",
   "en": "You're interested in me because of my visions. You just want to know more about the Protheans.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09049",
   "en": "Don't try to justify this! You're obsessed!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09050",
   "en": "Sorry. Guess I overreacted.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09051",
   "en": "I don't care what the rest of the galaxy thinks about me. On this ship, I am in charge. And I don't like my crew digging into my past!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09052",
   "en": "I see your point.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09053",
   "en": "That wouldn't happen. I'm only interested in men.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09054",
   "en": "My relationships are none of your business.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09055",
   "en": "I care about Kaidan. A lot.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09056",
   "en": "We're not even the same species.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09057",
   "en": "You're right. I'm already spoken for.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09058",
   "en": "I care about Ash. A lot.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09059",
   "en": "You want a relationship with me? Even though we're both women?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09060",
   "en": "The lieutenant and I are just friends. Nothing more.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09061",
   "en": "How could we have a relationship? We're not even the same species.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09062",
   "en": "Williams and I are just friends. Nothing more.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09063",
   "en": "We're short-lived.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09064",
   "en": "What about now?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09065",
   "en": "That's insulting.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09066",
   "en": "Intimidating?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09067",
   "en": "That's still insulting.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09068",
   "en": "It works for us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09069",
   "en": "I'm trying.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09070",
   "en": "Me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09071",
   "en": "You could've asked.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09072",
   "en": "You spied on me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09073",
   "en": "You looked that up?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09074",
   "en": "I want to believe that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09075",
   "en": "Me? Or the beacon?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09076",
   "en": "Unacceptable!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09077",
   "en": "This has to stop!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09078",
   "en": "But you're female!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09079",
   "en": "That's private.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09080",
   "en": "Kaidan's special.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09081",
   "en": "You're an alien!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09082",
   "en": "I'm taken.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09083",
   "en": "Ash is special.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09084",
   "en": "You're female!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09085",
   "en": "It's not serious.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09086",
   "en": "It's not right. You did everything they asked and more. Nobody else could have done what you did!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09087",
   "en": "The Council owes you everything. Everything! Instead, they strip you of your command and ground the Normandy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09088",
   "en": "Perhaps we could appeal and get them to reverse their decision.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09089",
   "en": "So you're going to walk away? You will just give up and doom the entire galaxy to extinction?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09090",
   "en": "I-- I am sorry, Commander. I was only trying to help.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09091",
   "en": "You'll think of something. You always do.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09092",
   "en": "Do not push me away! I am not the one who angers you!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09093",
   "en": "I believe in you, Shepard. I am with you every step of the way.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09094",
   "en": "I apologize, Commander. I should not have mentioned it. Please, let's talk about something else.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09095",
   "en": "I thought so. I should never have mentioned this. Please, Commander, let's talk about something else.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09096",
   "en": "We asari are mono-gendered, Commander. \"Male\" and \"female\" don't have any real meaning for us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09097",
   "en": "We do, however, have maternal instincts. So perhaps we would fill what you consider a female role.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09098",
   "en": "I apologize if I have made you uncomfortable, Commander. As I said, I wouldn't want to come between you and Lt. Alenko. Maybe it would be best if we spoke about something else.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09099",
   "en": "But none of this matters if you are already involved in a serious relationship with Lt. Alenko.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09100",
   "en": "Asari and humans are physiologically compatible in most ways, Commander. Of course, a relationship must involve more than mere physical contact.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09101",
   "en": "There must also be an emotional and spiritual connection between us. Our species may be different, but there are many things we could share.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09102",
   "en": "But as I mentioned before, I would not feel right intruding on your relationship with Chief Williams. Perhaps we should speak of something else.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09103",
   "en": "But none of this matters if you are already involved in a serious relationship with Chief Williams.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09104",
   "en": "My mistake, then. I am not as adept at understanding human relationships as I thought.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09105",
   "en": "But what about us, Shepard? Is there a mutual attraction? Or was I wrong about that, too?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09106",
   "en": "I thought so. Still, I feel as if there is also some attraction between us, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09107",
   "en": "I see. I apologize if I have made you uncomfortable, Commander. It will not happen again. Please, let us just talk about something else.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09108",
   "en": "I apologize, Commander. I did not mean to pry. I thought there was a mutual attraction between us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09109",
   "en": "Obviously, I do not know as much about human relationships as I thought.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09110",
   "en": "I knew it! And I knew you felt it, too. But... does this not seem rather strange? Why do I feel so close to you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09111",
   "en": "We have only known each other a short time. We are from two different species. We have almost nothing in common. This makes no sense!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09112",
   "en": "You make it sound so... chaotic. So... dangerous.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09113",
   "en": "That is not the most romantic reason, is it? You make it all sound so... dangerous.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09114",
   "en": "I am not looking for a protector...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09115",
   "en": "This is all a bit overwhelming. I am not used to... this. You. I need some time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09116",
   "en": "I know. I'm sorry. But I did not think it would get so.... Please, let's just talk about something else.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09117",
   "en": "This is very embarrassing for me, Commander. Please, let's talk about something else.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09118",
   "en": "You have been very understanding with me, Shepard. Very patient. I appreciate that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09119",
   "en": "I know there are some strange beliefs about my people. I am familiar with the legend of asari promiscuity. But those rumors have little basis in fact.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09120",
   "en": "When one of my people joins with an individual from another species, it is a very deep and spiritual exchange. We do not enter lightly into a union.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09121",
   "en": "A true union goes far beyond an ordinary melding. It is a connection that transcends the physical universe.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09122",
   "en": "Two become one. Thoughts and senses merge. Identities intertwine. Memories and emotions weave themselves together, becoming entangled in a single, rapturous whole.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09123",
   "en": "It is unlike any other experience. In some cases, it can be a truly life-changing event.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09124",
   "en": "No! Oh, no! Uh, I am not very good at this, am I? I'm sorry, Shepard. I am trying to explain why I have been so... reserved.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09125",
   "en": "The union is more than just sex. It is the life-blood of my species, the way we asari evolve and grow as a society.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09126",
   "en": "That is why I have never... uh, I mean, that is why we must choose our partners with great care.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09127",
   "en": "\"Virgin\" does not have the same connotation in my culture as in yours. But it is true that I have never done this before.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09128",
   "en": "I am only one hundred and six, barely an adult by asari standards. And I spend most of my time absorbed in my research.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09129",
   "en": "I never really thought about it. Not until I met you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09130",
   "en": "You are very special to me, Shepard. But with all that's happened--Saren, the geth, the Reapers--I do not know if we are ready for this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u09131",
   "en": "I'm glad you understand, Shepard. There is too much at stake. We need to put aside our personal feelings and focus on stopping Saren.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
